cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "scout-mcp: scout's MCP server diagnostics as read-only MCP tools"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/scout-mcp"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server over stdio that exposes scout, the MCP
  server diagnostic, as three read-only tools: evaluate an allowlisted
  Streamable HTTP endpoint and return its score and failing checks, verify
  a scout attestation offline, and report the versions in use. It sends no
  credentials and never lets scout invoke a mutating tool.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - mcp-server
  - diagnostics
  - golang
license: GPL-3.0-only
